{"text":"<p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p><span><a>https://youtu.be/Zs9FwvwFauY?si=24VFp7NyyLW-P-jo</a></span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"0\">00:00</span> ### 1. Paṭhamanayo ^3-1-0</span></p><br /><p><span>#### 1. Saṅgahāsaṅgahapadaniddeso ^3-1a-0</span></p><br /><p><span>##### 1. Khandho</span></p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4.117782\">00:04</span> 6.</span> Rūpakkhandho katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahito? Rūpakkhandho ekena khandhena ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi saṅgahito. Katihi asaṅgahito? Catūhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi asaṅgahito. ^3-1a-6</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"38.147686\">00:38</span> 7.</span> Vedanākkhandho katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahito? Vedanākkhandho ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahito. Katihi asaṅgahito? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahito. ^3-1a-7</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"71.122014\">01:11</span> 8.</span> Saññākkhandho katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahito? Saññākkhandho ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahito. Katihi asaṅgahito? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahito. ^3-1a-8</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"102.014618\">01:42</span> 9.</span> Saṅkhārakkhandho katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahito? Saṅkhārakkhandho ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahito. Katihi asaṅgahito? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahito. ^3-1a-9</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"134.429578\">02:14</span> 10.</span> Viññāṇakkhandho katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahito? Viññāṇakkhandho ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi saṅgahito. Katihi asaṅgahito? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahito. ^3-1a-10</p><br /><p>(Ekamūlakaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"166.113602\">02:46</span> 11.</span> Rūpakkhandho ca vedanākkhandho ca katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahitā? Rūpakkhandho ca vedanākkhandho ca dvīhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-11</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"203.256702\">03:23</span> 12.</span> Rūpakkhandho ca saññākkhandho ca…pe… dvīhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-12</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"229.993549\">03:49</span> 13.</span> Rūpakkhandho ca saṅkhārakkhandho ca…pe… dvīhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-13</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"255.506257\">04:15</span> 14.</span> Rūpakkhandho ca viññāṇakkhandho ca…pe… dvīhi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Tīhi khandhehi, na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-14</p><br /><p>(Dukamūlakaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"283.280471\">04:43</span> 15.</span> Rūpakkhandho ca vedanākkhandho ca saññākkhandho ca katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahitā? Rūpakkhandho ca vedanākkhandho ca saññākkhandho ca tīhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Dvīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-15</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"325.638639\">05:25</span> 16.</span> Rūpakkhandho ca vedanākkhandho ca saṅkhārakkhandho ca…pe… tīhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Dvīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-16</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"355.06147\">05:55</span> 17.</span> Rūpakkhandho ca vedanākkhandho ca viññāṇakkhandho ca…pe… tīhi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Dvīhi khandhehi, na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-17</p><br /><p>(Tikamūlakaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"385.959963\">06:25</span> 18.</span> Rūpakkhandho ca vedanākkhandho ca saññākkhandho ca saṅkhārakkhandho ca katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahitā? Rūpakkhandho ca vedanākkhandho ca saññākkhandho ca saṅkhārakkhandho ca catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-18</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"433.472201\">07:13</span> 19.</span> Rūpakkhandho ca vedanākkhandho ca saññākkhandho ca viññāṇakkhandho ca…pe… catūhi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena, na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-19</p><br /><p>(Catukkamūlakaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"466.35121\">07:46</span> 20.</span> Rūpakkhandho ca vedanākkhandho ca saññākkhandho ca saṅkhārakkhandho ca viññāṇakkhandho ca katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahitā? Rūpakkhandho ca vedanākkhandho ca saññākkhandho ca saṅkhārakkhandho ca viññāṇakkhandho ca pañcahi khandhehi dvādasāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-20</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"521.20059\">08:41</span> 21.</span> Pañcakkhandhā katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahitā? Pañcakkhandhā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-21</p><br /><p>(Pañcakaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span>##### 2. Āyatanaṃ</span></p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"554.53215\">09:14</span> 22.</span> Cakkhāyatanaṃ katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahitaṃ? Cakkhāyatanaṃ ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-22</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"586.466009\">09:46</span> 23.</span> Sotāyatanaṃ … ghānāyatanaṃ… jivhāyatanaṃ… kāyāyatanaṃ… rūpāyatanaṃ… saddāyatanaṃ… gandhāyatanaṃ… rasāyatanaṃ… phoṭṭhabbāyatanaṃ…pe… ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-23</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"626.732199\">10:26</span> 24.</span> Manāyatanaṃ ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-24</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"650.919896\">10:50</span> 25.</span> Dhammāyatanaṃ asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā catūhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Ekena khandhena ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-25</p><br /><p>(Ekamūlakaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"678.117433\">11:18</span> 26.</span> Cakkhāyatanañca sotāyatanañca ekena khandhena dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-26</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"703.628749\">11:43</span> 27.</span> Cakkhāyatanañca ghānāyatanañca… cakkhāyatanañca jivhāyatanañca… cakkhāyatanañca kāyāyatanañca… cakkhāyatanañca rūpāyatanañca… cakkhāyatanañca saddāyatanañca… cakkhāyatanañca gandhāyatanañca… cakkhāyatanañca rasāyatanañca… cakkhāyatanañca phoṭṭhabbāyatanañca ekena khandhena dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-27</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"760.289489\">12:40</span> 28.</span> Cakkhāyatanañca manāyatanañca dvīhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi aṭṭhahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Tīhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-28</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"785.036368\">13:05</span> 29.</span> Cakkhāyatanañca dhammāyatanañca asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-29</p><br /><p>(Dukamūlakaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"814.37546\">13:34</span> 30.</span> Dvādasāyatanāni katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahitā? Dvādasāyatanāni asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-30</p><br /><p>(Dvādasakaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span>##### 3. Dhātu</span></p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"854.932012\">14:14</span> 31.</span> Cakkhudhātu katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahitā? Cakkhudhātu ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-31</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"887.891093\">14:47</span> 32.</span> Sotadhātu… ghānadhātu… jivhādhātu… kāyadhātu… rūpadhātu… saddadhātu… gandhadhātu… rasadhātu… phoṭṭhabbadhātu… cakkhuviññāṇadhātu… sotaviññāṇadhātu… ghānaviññāṇadhātu… jivhāviññāṇadhātu… kāyaviññāṇadhātu… manodhātu… manoviññāṇadhātu ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-32</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"948.29093\">15:48</span> 33.</span> Dhammadhātu asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā catūhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-33</p><br /><p>(Ekamūlakaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"977.317372\">16:17</span> 34.</span> Cakkhudhātu ca sotadhātu ca ekena khandhena dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-34</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1003.038838\">16:43</span> 35.</span> Cakkhudhātu ca ghānadhātu ca… cakkhudhātu ca jivhādhātu ca… cakkhudhātu ca kāyadhātu ca… cakkhudhātu ca rūpadhātu ca… cakkhudhātu ca saddadhātu ca… cakkhudhātu ca gandhadhātu ca… cakkhudhātu ca rasadhātu ca… cakkhudhātu ca phoṭṭhabbadhātu ca ekena khandhena dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-35</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1057.714065\">17:37</span> 36.</span> Cakkhudhātu ca cakkhuviññāṇadhātu ca dvīhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Tīhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-36</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1083.582703\">18:03</span> 37.</span> Cakkhudhātu ca sotaviññāṇadhātu ca… cakkhudhātu ca ghānaviññāṇadhātu ca… cakkhudhātu ca jivhāviññāṇadhātu ca… cakkhudhātu ca kāyaviññāṇadhātu ca… cakkhudhātu ca manodhātu ca… cakkhudhātu ca manoviññāṇadhātu ca dvīhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Tīhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-37</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1133.647093\">18:53</span> 38.</span> Cakkhudhātu ca dhammadhātu ca asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-38</p><br /><p>(Dukamūlakaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1162.976072\">19:22</span> 39.</span> Aṭṭhārasa dhātuyo katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahitā? Aṭṭhārasa dhātuyo asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-39</p><br /><p>(Aṭṭhārasakaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span>##### 4. Saccaṃ</span></p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1203.115227\">20:03</span> 40.</span> Dukkhasaccaṃ katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahitaṃ? Dukkhasaccaṃ pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-40</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1239.555117\">20:39</span> 41.</span> Samudayasaccaṃ … maggasaccaṃ ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-41</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1267.125621\">21:07</span> 42.</span> Nirodhasaccaṃ na kehici khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Pañcahi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-42</p><br /><p>(Ekamūlakaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1292.964335\">21:32</span> 43.</span> Dukkhasaccañca samudayasaccañca pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-43</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1323.478554\">22:03</span> 44.</span> Dukkhasaccañca maggasaccañca pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-44</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1354.524568\">22:34</span> 45.</span> Dukkhasaccañca nirodhasaccañca asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-45</p><br /><p>(Dukamūlakaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1388.552065\">23:08</span> 46.</span> Dukkhasaccañca samudayasaccañca maggasaccañca pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-46</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1421.197601\">23:41</span> 47.</span> Dukkhasaccañca samudayasaccañca nirodhasaccañca asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-47</p><br /><p>(Tikamūlakaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1459.186682\">24:19</span> 48.</span> Dukkhasaccañca samudayasaccañca maggasaccañca nirodhasaccañca asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-48</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1499.037889\">24:59</span> 49.</span> Cattāri saccāni katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahitāni? Cattāri saccāni asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitāni. Katihi asaṅgahitāni? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitāni. ^3-1a-49</p><br /><p>(Catukkaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span>##### 5. Indriyaṃ</span></p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1541.438637\">25:41</span> 50.</span> Cakkhundriyaṃ katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahitaṃ? Cakkhundriyaṃ ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-50</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1574.999118\">26:14</span> 51.</span> Sotindriyaṃ… ghānindriyaṃ… jivhindriyaṃ… kāyindriyaṃ… itthindriyaṃ … purisindriyaṃ ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-51</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1608.429968\">26:48</span> 52.</span> Manindriyaṃ ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-52</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1633.687452\">27:13</span> 53.</span> Jīvitindriyaṃ dvīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Tīhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-53</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1658.394582\">27:38</span> 54.</span> Sukhindriyaṃ … dukkhindriyaṃ… somanassindriyaṃ… domanassindriyaṃ… upekkhindriyaṃ… saddhindriyaṃ… vīriyindriyaṃ… satindriyaṃ… samādhindriyaṃ… paññindriyaṃ… anaññātaññassāmītindriyaṃ… aññindriyaṃ… aññātāvindriyaṃ ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-54</p><br /><p>(Ekamūlakaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1708.088983\">28:28</span> 55.</span> Cakkhundriyañca sotindriyañca ekena khandhena dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-55</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1734.59848\">28:54</span> 56.</span> Cakkhundriyañca ghānindriyañca… cakkhundriyañca jivhindriyañca… cakkhundriyañca kāyindriyañca… cakkhundriyañca itthindriyañca… cakkhundriyañca purisindriyañca ekena khandhena dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-56</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1776.750524\">29:36</span> 57.</span> Cakkhundriyañca manindriyañca dvīhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi aṭṭhahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Tīhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-57</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1802.562488\">30:02</span> 58.</span> Cakkhundriyañca jīvitindriyañca dvīhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Tīhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-58</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1828.811666\">30:28</span> 59.</span> Cakkhundriyañca sukhindriyañca… cakkhundriyañca dukkhindriyañca… cakkhundriyañca somanassindriyañca… cakkhundriyañca domanassindriyañca… cakkhundriyañca upekkhindriyañca… cakkhundriyañca saddhindriyañca… cakkhundriyañca vīriyindriyañca… cakkhundriyañca satindriyañca… cakkhundriyañca samādhindriyañca… cakkhundriyañca paññindriyañca… cakkhundriyañca anaññātaññassāmītindriyañca… cakkhundriyañca aññindriyañca… cakkhundriyañca aññātāvindriyañca dvīhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Tīhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-59</p><br /><p>(Dukamūlakaṃ.)</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1907.440347\">31:47</span> 60.</span> Bāvīsatindriyāni katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahitāni? Bāvīsatindriyāni catūhi khandhehi sattahāyatanehi terasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitāni. Katihi asaṅgahitāni? Ekena khandhena pañcahāyatanehi pañcahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitāni. ^3-1a-60</p><br /><p><span>##### 6. Paṭiccasamuppādādi</span></p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1942.764182\">32:22</span> 61.</span> Avijjā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-61</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1966.957423\">32:46</span> 62.</span> Avijjāpaccayā saṅkhārā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-62</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1993.782197\">33:13</span> 63.</span> Saṅkhārapaccayā viññāṇaṃ ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-63</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2020.83504\">33:40</span> 64.</span> Viññāṇapaccayā nāmarūpaṃ catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-64</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2047.560676\">34:07</span> 65.</span> Nāmarūpapaccayā saḷāyatanaṃ dvīhi khandhehi chahāyatanehi dvādasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Tīhi khandhehi chahāyatanehi chahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-65</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2073.370253\">34:33</span> 66.</span> Saḷāyatanapaccayā phasso… phassapaccayā vedanā… vedanāpaccayā taṇhā… taṇhāpaccayā upādānaṃ… kammabhavo [upādānapaccayā kammabhavo (sī. syā.)] ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahito. Katihi asaṅgahito? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahito. ^3-1a-66</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2114.293053\">35:14</span> 67.</span> Upapattibhavo … kāmabhavo… saññābhavo… pañcavokārabhavo pañcahi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi saṅgahito. Katihi asaṅgahito? Na kehici khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā asaṅgahito. ^3-1a-67</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2146.451299\">35:46</span> 68.</span> Rūpabhavo pañcahi khandhehi pañcahāyatanehi aṭṭhahi dhātūhi saṅgahito. Katihi asaṅgahito? Na kehici khandhehi sattahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahito. ^3-1a-68</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2171.305456\">36:11</span> 69.</span> Arūpabhavo… nevasaññānāsaññābhavo… catuvokārabhavo catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahito. Katihi asaṅgahito? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahito. ^3-1a-69</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2201.39924\">36:41</span> 70.</span> Asaññābhavo… ekavokārabhavo ekena khandhena dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahito. Katihi asaṅgahito? Catūhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahito. ^3-1a-70</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2228.59392\">37:08</span> 71.</span> Jāti dvīhi khandhehi… jarā dvīhi khandhehi… maraṇaṃ dvīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Tīhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-71</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2259.404791\">37:39</span> 72.</span> Soko… paridevo… dukkhaṃ… domanassaṃ… upāyāso… satipaṭṭhānaṃ… sammappadhānaṃ ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-72</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2293.012283\">38:13</span> 73.</span> Iddhipādo dvīhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahito. Katihi asaṅgahito? Tīhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahito. ^3-1a-73</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2316.877842\">38:36</span> 74.</span> Jhānaṃ dvīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Tīhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-74</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2340.087266\">39:00</span> 75.</span> Appamaññā … pañcindriyāni… pañca balāni… satta bojjhaṅgā… ariyo aṭṭhaṅgiko maggo… phasso… vedanā… saññā… cetanā… adhimokkho… manasikāro ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahito. Katihi asaṅgahito? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahito. ^3-1a-75</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2384.251833\">39:44</span> 76.</span> Cittaṃ ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi saṅgahitaṃ. Katihi asaṅgahitaṃ? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitaṃ. ^3-1a-76</p><br /><p><span>##### 7. Tikaṃ</span></p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2407.67597\">40:07</span> 77.</span> Kusalā dhammā… akusalā dhammā katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahitā? Kusalā dhammā… akusalā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-77</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2446.024254\">40:46</span> 78.</span> Abyākatā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-78</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2478.837434\">41:18</span> 79.</span> Sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttā dhammā… dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttā dhammā tīhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi tīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Dvīhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi pannarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-79</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2511.167158\">41:51</span> 80.</span> Adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttā dhammā tīhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi sattahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Dvīhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-80</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2538.769599\">42:18</span> 81.</span> Vipākā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi aṭṭhahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-81</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2564.209307\">42:44</span>  82.</span><span> Vipākadhammadhammā… saṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-82</span></p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2593.090547\">43:13</span> 83.</span> Nevavipākanavipākadhammadhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi terasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā ? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi pañcahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-83</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2626.510236\">43:46</span> 84.</span> Upādinnupādāniyā dhammā pañcahi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-84</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2654.54086\">44:14</span> 85.</span> Anupādinnupādāniyā dhammā pañcahi khandhehi sattahāyatanehi aṭṭhahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi pañcahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-85</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2681.360848\">44:41</span> 86.</span> Anupādinnaanupādāniyā dhammā… asaṃkiliṭṭhaasaṃkilesikā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-86</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2717.781317\">45:17</span> 87.</span> Asaṃkiliṭṭhasaṃkilesikā dhammā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-87</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2748.087461\">45:48</span> 88.</span> Savitakkasavicārā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi tīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi pannarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-88</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2773.398599\">46:13</span> 89.</span> Avitakkavicāramattā dhammā… pītisahagatā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-89</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2802.660559\">46:42</span> 90.</span> Avitakkaavicārā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi ekāya dhātuyā asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-90</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2834.880125\">47:14</span> 91.</span> Sukhasahagatā dhammā tīhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi tīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Dvīhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi pannarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-91</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2860.33498\">47:40</span> 92.</span> Upekkhāsahagatā dhammā tīhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi sattahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Dvīhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-92</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2886.152345\">48:06</span> 93.</span> Dassanena pahātabbā dhammā… bhāvanāya pahātabbā dhammā… dassanena pahātabbahetukā dhammā… bhāvanāya pahātabbahetukā dhammā… ācayagāmino dhammā… apacayagāmino dhammā… sekkhā dhammā… asekkhā dhammā… mahaggatā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-93</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2937.233175\">48:57</span> 94.</span> Neva dassanena na bhāvanāya pahātabbā dhammā… neva dassanena na bhāvanāya pahātabbahetukā dhammā… nevācayagāmināpacayagāmino dhammā… nevasekkhanāsekkhā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-94</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2989.30016\">49:49</span> 95.</span> Parittā dhammā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-95</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3017.719915\">50:17</span> 96.</span> Appamāṇā dhammā… paṇītā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-96</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3049.394145\">50:49</span> 97.</span> Parittārammaṇā [parittāramaṇā (?)] dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi aṭṭhahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-97</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3074.970112\">51:14</span> 98.</span> Mahaggatārammaṇā dhammā… appamāṇārammaṇā dhammā… hīnā dhammā… micchattaniyatā dhammā… sammattaniyatā dhammā… maggārammaṇā dhammā… maggahetukā dhammā… maggādhipatino dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-98</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3120.619265\">52:00</span> 99.</span> Majjhimā dhammā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-99</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3149.120358\">52:29</span> 100.</span> Aniyatā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-100</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3181.621148\">53:01</span> 101.</span> Uppannā dhammā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-101</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3210.578496\">53:30</span> 102.</span> Anuppannā dhammā pañcahi khandhehi sattahāyatanehi aṭṭhahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi pañcahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-102</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3237.259532\">53:57</span> 103.</span> Uppādino dhammā pañcahi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-103</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3264.125808\">54:24</span> 104.</span> Atītā dhammā… anāgatā dhammā… paccuppannā dhammā… ajjhattā dhammā… ajjhattabahiddhā dhammā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-104</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3303.214529\">55:03</span> 105.</span> Bahiddhā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-105</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3335.883743\">55:35</span>  106.</span> Atītārammaṇā dhammā… anāgatārammaṇā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-106</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3365.117359\">56:05</span> 107.</span> Paccuppannārammaṇā dhammā… ajjhattārammaṇā dhammā… bahiddhārammaṇā dhammā… ajjhattabahiddhārammaṇā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi aṭṭhahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-107</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3402.478837\">56:42</span> 108.</span> Sanidassanasappaṭighā dhammā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitā . Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-108</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3427.823313\">57:07</span> 109.</span> Anidassanasappaṭighā dhammā ekena khandhena navahāyatanehi navahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi tīhāyatanehi navahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-109</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3454.715565\">57:34</span> 110.</span> Anidassanaappaṭighā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi aṭṭhahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi, dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-110</p><br /><p><span>##### 8. Dukaṃ</span></p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3484.872272\">58:04</span> 111.</span> Hetū dhammā… hetū ceva sahetukā ca dhammā… hetū ceva hetusampayuttā ca dhammā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-111</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3520.240611\">58:40</span> 112.</span> Na hetū dhammā… ahetukā dhammā… hetuvippayuttā dhammā… na hetū ahetukā [na hetū ahetukā (syā. ka.) vibha. dukapañhāpucchakepi] dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-112</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3561.756997\">59:21</span> 113.</span> Sahetukā dhammā… hetusampayuttā dhammā… sahetukā ceva na ca hetū dhammā… hetusampayuttā ceva na ca hetū dhammā… na hetū sahetukā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-113</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3603.222591\">1:00:03</span> 114.</span> Sappaccayā dhammā… saṅkhatā dhammā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-114</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3632.928023\">1:00:32</span> 115.</span> Appaccayā dhammā… asaṅkhatā dhammā na kehici khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Pañcahi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-115</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3661.772535\">1:01:01</span> 116.</span> Sanidassanā dhammā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-116</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3688.078103\">1:01:28</span> 117.</span> Anidassanā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi, ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-117</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3718.825164\">1:01:58</span> 118.</span> Sappaṭighā dhammā ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi aṭṭhahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-118</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3743.594162\">1:02:23</span> 119.</span> Appaṭighā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi aṭṭhahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi, dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-119</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3773.302219\">1:02:53</span> 120.</span> Rūpino dhammā ekena khandhena ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-120</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3799.736064\">1:03:19</span> 121.</span> Arūpino dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi aṭṭhahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-121</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3829.946338\">1:03:49</span> 122.</span> Lokiyā dhammā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-122</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3857.879067\">1:04:17</span> 123.</span> Lokuttarā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-123</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3887.150681\">1:04:47</span> 124.</span> Kenaci viññeyyā dhammā… kenaci na viññeyyā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-124</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3924.214186\">1:05:24</span> 125.</span> Āsavā dhammā… āsavā ceva sāsavā ca dhammā… āsavā ceva āsavasampayuttā ca dhammā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-125</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3960.46425\">1:06:00</span> 126.</span> No āsavā dhammā… āsavavippayuttā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-126</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"3996.030387\">1:06:36</span> 127.</span> Sāsavā dhammā… sāsavā ceva no ca āsavā dhammā… āsavavippayuttā sāsavā dhammā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-127</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4032.477794\">1:07:12</span> 128.</span> Anāsavā dhammā… āsavavippayuttā anāsavā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-128</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4065.997684\">1:07:45</span> 129.</span> Āsavasampayuttā dhammā… āsavasampayuttā ceva no ca āsavā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-129</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4099.46138\">1:08:19</span> 130.</span> Saṃyojanā dhammā… ganthā dhammā… oghā dhammā… yogā dhammā… nīvaraṇā dhammā… parāmāsā dhammā… parāmāsā ceva parāmaṭṭhā ca dhammā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-130</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4141.013069\">1:09:01</span> 131.</span> No parāmāsā dhammā… parāmāsavippayuttā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā . Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-131</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4177.916027\">1:09:37</span> 132.</span> Parāmaṭṭhā dhammā… parāmaṭṭhā ceva no ca parāmāsā dhammā… parāmāsavippayuttā parāmaṭṭhā dhammā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-132</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4216.33641\">1:10:16</span> 133.</span> Aparāmaṭṭhā dhammā… parāmāsavippayuttā aparāmaṭṭhā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-133</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4251.152368\">1:10:51</span> 134.</span> Parāmāsasampayuttā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-134</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4277.298653\">1:11:17</span> 135.</span> Sārammaṇā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi aṭṭhahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-135</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4300.495075\">1:11:40</span> 136.</span> Anārammaṇā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā ekena khandhena ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-136</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4330.757755\">1:12:10</span> 137.</span> Cittā dhammā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-137</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4357.469248\">1:12:37</span> 138.</span> No cittā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-138</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4388.635555\">1:13:08</span> 139.</span> Cetasikā dhammā… cittasampayuttā dhammā… cittasaṃsaṭṭhā dhammā tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Dvīhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-139</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4421.749635\">1:13:41</span> 140.</span> Acetasikā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā dvīhi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Tīhi khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-140</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4453.879472\">1:14:13</span> 141.</span> Cittavippayuttā dhammā… cittavisaṃsaṭṭhā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā ekena khandhena ekādasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena sattahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-141</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4488.370613\">1:14:48</span> 142.</span> Cittasamuṭṭhānā dhammā catūhi khandhehi chahāyatanehi chahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena chahāyatanehi dvādasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-142</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4512.696133\">1:15:12</span> 143.</span> No cittasamuṭṭhānā dhammā… no cittasahabhuno dhammā… no cittānuparivattino dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā dvīhi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Tīhi khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-143</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4552.325428\">1:15:52</span> 144.</span> Cittasahabhuno dhammā… cittānuparivattino dhammā catūhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-144</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4583.591786\">1:16:23</span> 145.</span> Cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānā dhammā… cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānasahabhuno dhammā… cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānānuparivattino dhammā tīhi khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Dvīhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-145</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4623.464194\">1:17:03</span> 146.</span> No cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānā dhammā… no cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānasahabhuno dhammā… no cittasaṃsaṭṭhasamuṭṭhānānuparivattino dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā dvīhi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Tīhi khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-146</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4670.132923\">1:17:50</span> 147.</span> Ajjhattikā dhammā dvīhi khandhehi chahāyatanehi dvādasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Tīhi khandhehi chahāyatanehi chahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-147</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4691.669404\">1:18:11</span> 148.</span> Bāhirā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā catūhi khandhehi chahāyatanehi chahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena chahāyatanehi dvādasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-148</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4720.878337\">1:18:40</span> 149.</span> Upādā dhammā ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi aṭṭhahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-149</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4746.358599\">1:19:06</span> 150.</span> No upādā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi tīhāyatanehi navahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi navahāyatanehi navahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-150</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4776.530213\">1:19:36</span> 151.</span> Upādinnā dhammā pañcahi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā . Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-151</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4802.877098\">1:20:02</span> 152.</span> Anupādinnā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi sattahāyatanehi aṭṭhahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi pañcahāyatanehi dasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-152</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4832.753055\">1:20:32</span> 153.</span> Upādānā dhammā… kilesā dhammā… kilesā ceva saṃkilesikā ca dhammā… kilesā ceva saṃkiliṭṭhā ca dhammā… kilesā ceva kilesasampayuttā ca dhammā ekena khandhena ekenāyatanena ekāya dhātuyā saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Catūhi khandhehi ekādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-153</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4876.799544\">1:21:16</span> 154.</span> No kilesā dhammā… asaṃkiliṭṭhā dhammā… kilesavippayuttā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-154</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4915.438434\">1:21:55</span> 155.</span> Saṃkilesikā dhammā… saṃkilesikā ceva no ca kilesā dhammā… kilesavippayuttā saṃkilesikā dhammā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-155</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4953.183498\">1:22:33</span> 156.</span> Asaṃkilesikā dhammā… kilesavippayuttā asaṃkilesikā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-156</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"4988.273191\">1:23:08</span> 157.</span> Saṃkiliṭṭhā dhammā… kilesasampayuttā dhammā… saṃkiliṭṭhā ceva no ca kilesā dhammā… kilesasampayuttā ceva no ca kilesā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-157</p><p><br /></p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5027.338603\">1:23:47</span><span> 158.</span><span> Dassanena pahātabbā dhammā… bhāvanāya pahātabbā dhammā… dassanena pahātabbahetukā dhammā… bhāvanāya pahātabbahetukā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-158</span><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5067.239212\">1:24:27</span><span>  159.</span><span> Na dassanena pahātabbā dhammā… na bhāvanāya pahātabbā dhammā … na dassanena pahātabbahetukā dhammā… na bhāvanāya pahātabbahetukā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-159</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5115.389071\">1:25:15</span><span> 160.</span><span> Savitakkā dhammā… savicārā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi tīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi pannarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-160</span><br /><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5142.695999\">1:25:42</span> <span>161.</span><span> Avitakkā dhammā… avicārā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi sattarasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi ekāya dhātuyā asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-161</span><br /><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5176.746753\">1:26:16</span>  162.</span> Sappītikā dhammā… pītisahagatā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-162</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5204.662504\">1:26:44</span>  163.</span> Appītikā dhammā… na pītisahagatā dhammā… na sukhasahagatā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-163</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5242.635255\">1:27:22</span>  164.</span> Suk hasahagatā dhammā tīhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi tīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Dvīhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi pannarasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-164</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5268.560759\">1:27:48</span> 165.</span> Upekkhāsahagatā dhammā tīhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi sattahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Dvīhi khandhehi dasahāyatanehi ekādasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-165</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5295.8212\">1:28:15</span> 166.</span> Na upekkhāsahagatā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi terasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi pañcahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-166</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5328.193294\">1:28:48</span> 167.</span> Kāmāvacarā dhammā… pariyāpannā dhammā… sauttarā dhammā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-167</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5362.536767\">1:29:22</span> 168.</span> Na kāmāvacarā dhammā… apariyāpannā dhammā… anuttarā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-168</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5397.95353\">1:29:57</span> 169.</span> Rūpāvacarā dhammā… arūpāvacarā dhammā… niyyānikā dhammā… niyatā dhammā… saraṇā dhammā catūhi khandhehi dvīhāyatanehi dvīhi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Ekena khandhena dasahāyatanehi soḷasahi dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-169</p><br /><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"5432.837438\">1:30:32</span> 170.</span> Na rūpāvacarā dhammā… na arūpāvacarā dhammā… aniyyānikā dhammā… aniyatā dhammā… araṇā dhammā katihi khandhehi katihāyatanehi katihi dhātūhi saṅgahitā? Araṇā dhammā asaṅkhataṃ khandhato ṭhapetvā pañcahi khandhehi dvādasahāyatanehi aṭṭhārasahi dhātūhi saṅgahitā. Katihi asaṅgahitā? Na kehici khandhehi na kehici āyatanehi na kāhici dhātūhi asaṅgahitā. ^3-1a-170</p><br /><p>Saṅgahāsaṅgahapadaniddeso paṭhamo.</p><br /><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p>","media-time":5450.969885031472}